<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?><mxfile host="app.diagrams.net" agent="HillGrow design review" version="24.7.8"><diagram id="master" name="Master Controller"><mxGraphModel dx="1400" dy="900" grid="0" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1600" pageHeight="1500" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="t0" value="HillGrow — Master Controller: feature map" style="text;html=1;fontSize=22;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="16" width="900" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="t1" value="Review copy generated from the approved system spec (2026-08-31). Colours show the sub-project that delivers each feature." style="text;html=1;fontSize=11;fontColor=#666666;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="48" width="1100" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pmasterg1" value="Hardware" style="swimlane;rounded=1;startSize=30;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;swimlaneFillColor=#ffffff;horizontal=1;arcSize=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="90" width="490" height="382" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pmasterg1r0" value="• ESP32-DevKitC-V4 — 8 MB flash (16 MB option), WROOM class (GPIO16/17 kept free so WROVER would also work)" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="pmasterg1"><mxGeometry x="4" y="32" width="482" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pmasterg1r1" value="• UART0 (GPIO1/3, USB): console — CLI + logs, 115200" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="pmasterg1"><mxGeometry x="4" y="72" width="482" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pmasterg1r2" value="• UART2 ring: TX GPIO19 → Zone 1 · RX GPIO18 ← last zone · 3.3 V TTL twisted pair, 115200, 10 kΩ pull-up on RX" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="pmasterg1"><mxGeometry x="4" y="96" width="482" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pmasterg1r3" value="• Wi-Fi APSTA: AP 192.168.7.7 (phone/PC → web UI, WPA2) + STA → house Wi-Fi (NTP, future cloud)" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="pmasterg1"><mxGeometry x="4" y="136" width="482" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pmasterg1r4" value="• I²C (GPIO21/22): DS3231 RTC @0x68 (time authority; AT24C32 EEPROM @0x57 unused) · SHT31 @0x44 room temp/RH (optional)" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="pmasterg1"><mxGeometry x="4" y="176" width="482" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pmasterg1r5" value="• PCF8575 @0x20, active-low relays: DUKA TT125 main fan · intake damper · exhaust→workshop damper · exhaust→outside damper · blackout shutter · reservoir refill solenoid" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="pmasterg1"><mxGeometry x="4" y="216" width="482" height="56" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pmasterg1r6" value="• Reservoir level sensing: floats / load cell — hardware choice fixed in SP5 spec · NC high-level float in series with solenoid coil as hardware backstop" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="pmasterg1"><mxGeometry x="4" y="272" width="482" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pmasterg1r7" value="• Rescue button GPIO15 (to GND) · status LED GPIO2" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="pmasterg1"><mxGeometry x="4" y="312" width="482" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pmasterg1r8" value="• Flash layout: rescue 1280 K (factory) · app A/B 2 × 2 MB · zone_fw staging 1.5 MB · LittleFS data ~1 MB (alarms + history)" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="pmasterg1"><mxGeometry x="4" y="336" width="482" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pmasterg2" value="Ring master / node manager — SP3" style="swimlane;rounded=1;startSize=30;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;swimlaneFillColor=#ffffff;horizontal=1;arcSize=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="496" width="490" height="318" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pmasterg2r0" value="• Discovery &amp; enrolment: new board heartbeats its MAC → auto-assigned lowest free id → appears in UI unconfigured" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="pmasterg2"><mxGeometry x="4" y="32" width="482" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pmasterg2r1" value="• Node health: ONLINE / DEGRADED (5 s) / OFFLINE (10 s) / FAULT / UPDATING, per node" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="pmasterg2"><mxGeometry x="4" y="72" width="482" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pmasterg2r2" value="• Ring-break blame: names the dead node or cable segment (e.g. &quot;Z2 dead or wire Z2→Z3&quot;)" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="pmasterg2"><mxGeometry x="4" y="112" width="482" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pmasterg2r3" value="• TIME_SYNC broadcast every 2 s: wall clock + tz, who-is-online mask, fleet inhibit flags (pumps/lights/all)" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="pmasterg2"><mxGeometry x="4" y="152" width="482" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pmasterg2r4" value="• Command forwarding: SET ZONE n … as CLI text, ACKed, exactly-once (safe for pump doses), reply passed back verbatim" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="pmasterg2"><mxGeometry x="4" y="192" width="482" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pmasterg2r5" value="• Config push with adopt-at-enrolment and revert-on-local-edit (Master always wins; NOTIFY CFG_REVERTED)" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="pmasterg2"><mxGeometry x="4" y="232" width="482" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pmasterg2r6" value="• Telemetry collection from 2 s heartbeats: per-shelf soil/outputs/faults + comm counters per node" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="pmasterg2"><mxGeometry x="4" y="272" width="482" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pmasterg3" value="Fleet &amp; self OTA — SP3/SP4" style="swimlane;rounded=1;startSize=30;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;swimlaneFillColor=#ffffff;horizontal=1;arcSize=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="838" width="490" height="214" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pmasterg3r0" value="• zone.bin uploaded once into the zone_fw staging partition (validated: magic, project name, version)" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="pmasterg3"><mxGeometry x="4" y="32" width="482" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pmasterg3r1" value="• Update zones: one at a time — ring command → zone enters safe state → reboots to rescue → rescue joins master AP and pulls /fw/zone.bin → flashes inactive slot → proves itself via heartbeat → next zone" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="pmasterg3"><mxGeometry x="4" y="72" width="482" height="56" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pmasterg3r2" value="• Rescue image on the updating zone repeats ring bytes so downstream zones stay online" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="pmasterg3"><mxGeometry x="4" y="128" width="482" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pmasterg3r3" value="• Failed node stops the sequence (no retry storms); alarms suppressed during the 180 s window" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="pmasterg3"><mxGeometry x="4" y="168" width="482" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pmasterg4" value="Legend" style="swimlane;rounded=1;startSize=30;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#999999;swimlaneFillColor=#ffffff;horizontal=1;arcSize=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="1076" width="490" height="134" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pmasterg4r0" value="• Colour = when it lands:  SP1 Foundation (blue) · SP2 Shelf control (green) · SP3 Ring link (orange) · SP4 Web UI (purple) · SP5 Global control (red) · Hardware (yellow) · Grey = out of scope V1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="pmasterg4"><mxGeometry x="4" y="32" width="482" height="56" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pmasterg4r1" value="• Source of truth: docs/superpowers/specs/2026-08-31-hillgrow-system-design.md (approved 2026-08-31) + docs/pin-mapping.md" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="pmasterg4"><mxGeometry x="4" y="88" width="482" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pmasterg5" value="CLI on UART0 — SP1" style="swimlane;rounded=1;startSize=30;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;swimlaneFillColor=#ffffff;horizontal=1;arcSize=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="560" y="90" width="490" height="302" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pmasterg5r0" value="• HillBT grammar: SET/GET · one OK/ERR reply line · trailing HELP on any prefix · NOTIFY pushes · generated help with ranges" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="pmasterg5"><mxGeometry x="4" y="32" width="482" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pmasterg5r1" value="• System: GET ID / VERSION / STATUS · SET LOG &lt;level&gt; [tag] · REBOOT CONFIRM · FACTORY RESET CONFIRM · SAVE" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="pmasterg5"><mxGeometry x="4" y="72" width="482" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pmasterg5r2" value="• Node admin: GET NODES / NODE / UNASSIGNED · SET NODE n NAME/MAC · CLEAR NODE (assign, rename, replace boards)" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="pmasterg5"><mxGeometry x="4" y="112" width="482" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pmasterg5r3" value="• Master relays: SET OUT n &lt;minutes&gt; — duration-bounded manual control (no unlock needed, web UI uses it too)" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="pmasterg5"><mxGeometry x="4" y="152" width="482" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pmasterg5r4" value="• Network/time: SET WIFI STA|AP · SET NTP · SET TZ · GET/SET TIME" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="pmasterg5"><mxGeometry x="4" y="192" width="482" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pmasterg5r5" value="• DEBUG ENABLE &lt;key&gt; (Kconfig, default hill) gates raw pokes (GPIO/PCA/PCF/ADC), FW rollback" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="pmasterg5"><mxGeometry x="4" y="216" width="482" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pmasterg5r6" value="• ZONE n prefix: any zone command runs remotely, reply verbatim — master needs no zone vocabulary" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="pmasterg5"><mxGeometry x="4" y="256" width="482" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pmasterg6" value="Config &amp; persistence — SP1" style="swimlane;rounded=1;startSize=30;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;swimlaneFillColor=#ffffff;horizontal=1;arcSize=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="560" y="416" width="490" height="222" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pmasterg6r0" value="• Zone table (MAC → id, auto-assigned) · per-zone logical configs zc1..8 · 16 crop profiles (Leafy/Fruiting/Seedling seeded, copy-on-apply + explicit REAPPLY)" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="pmasterg6"><mxGeometry x="4" y="32" width="482" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pmasterg6r1" value="• Master config: Wi-Fi credentials (single home, RAM-loaded), TZ, NTP host" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="pmasterg6"><mxGeometry x="4" y="72" width="482" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pmasterg6r2" value="• Every stored blob wears a magic+version+CRC envelope; a dedicated store task is the only flash writer; write throttling against NVS wear" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="pmasterg6"><mxGeometry x="4" y="96" width="482" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pmasterg6r3" value="• Master NVS loss self-heals: zones re-enrol and their cached configs are adopted back" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="pmasterg6"><mxGeometry x="4" y="136" width="482" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pmasterg6r4" value="• JSON export/import of the whole system (disaster-recovery backup, includes Wi-Fi creds; ?secrets=0 to omit)" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="pmasterg6"><mxGeometry x="4" y="176" width="482" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pmasterg7" value="Rescue &amp; bootloader — SP1" style="swimlane;rounded=1;startSize=30;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;swimlaneFillColor=#ffffff;horizontal=1;arcSize=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="560" y="662" width="490" height="158" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pmasterg7r0" value="• Custom bootloader: app-requested RTC flag → rescue once · GPIO15 ≥10 s → rescue · 1–9 s → NVS factory erase · rollback when a new image never proves itself" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="pmasterg7"><mxGeometry x="4" y="32" width="482" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pmasterg7r1" value="• Shared rescue image (same binary on master and zones): manual mode = AP HillGrow-Rescue-&lt;MAC&gt; @192.168.7.7 with one upload page" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="pmasterg7"><mxGeometry x="4" y="72" width="482" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pmasterg7r2" value="• Master self-update: web upload straight into the inactive A/B slot; reboot; self-test or automatic rollback" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="pmasterg7"><mxGeometry x="4" y="112" width="482" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pmasterg8" value="Safety &amp; robustness — SP1/SP2" style="swimlane;rounded=1;startSize=30;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;swimlaneFillColor=#ffffff;horizontal=1;arcSize=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="560" y="844" width="490" height="222" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pmasterg8r0" value="• Task watchdog 8 s with panic, all app tasks subscribed, idle tasks watched · interrupt WDT · brown-out 2.80 V" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="pmasterg8"><mxGeometry x="4" y="32" width="482" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pmasterg8r1" value="• Modes BOOT / TRIAL / HOLD / RUN / SAFE (LOCAL is zone-only) · crash-loop ladder: 3 abnormal resets → 300 s HOLD → latched SAFE (≤9 output pulses ever)" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="pmasterg8"><mxGeometry x="4" y="72" width="482" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pmasterg8r2" value="• PCF8575 read-back audit (1 s) · I²C recovery ladder → SAFE on persistent bus failure · shutdown handler forces relays off on every restart" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="pmasterg8"><mxGeometry x="4" y="112" width="482" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pmasterg8r3" value="• OTA trial: fresh image must bring up AP + web server or it rolls back" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="pmasterg8"><mxGeometry x="4" y="152" width="482" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pmasterg8r4" value="• One safety gate for every output — web/cloud/CLI can never bypass local interlocks" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="pmasterg8"><mxGeometry x="4" y="176" width="482" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pmasterg9" value="Web UI + HTTP API — SP4" style="swimlane;rounded=1;startSize=30;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;swimlaneFillColor=#ffffff;horizontal=1;arcSize=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1080" y="90" width="490" height="326" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pmasterg9r0" value="• Dashboard: all zones and shelves live (1 Hz polling) — soil %, outputs, modes, faults, node health" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="pmasterg9"><mxGeometry x="4" y="32" width="482" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pmasterg9r1" value="• Configuration editing: zone naming/assignment, per-shelf crop + light/water/fan/pollination settings, profiles" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="pmasterg9"><mxGeometry x="4" y="72" width="482" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pmasterg9r2" value="• Alarms: active + history, acknowledge/clear" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="pmasterg9"><mxGeometry x="4" y="112" width="482" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pmasterg9r3" value="• History plots: 10-minute samples (3 days) + hourly aggregates (30 days), per shelf" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="pmasterg9"><mxGeometry x="4" y="136" width="482" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pmasterg9r4" value="• Export: hourly history as a plain-text file download" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="pmasterg9"><mxGeometry x="4" y="176" width="482" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pmasterg9r5" value="• Firmware page: upload master.bin (self-update) · upload zone.bin (staging) · Update-zones button with progress" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="pmasterg9"><mxGeometry x="4" y="200" width="482" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pmasterg9r6" value="• POST /api/cmd: every button sends a CLI line — one grammar, one safety path, copy-pasteable into PuTTY" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="pmasterg9"><mxGeometry x="4" y="240" width="482" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pmasterg9r7" value="• Served from the AP at 192.168.7.7 (works with zero internet); assets embedded gzipped in the app image" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="pmasterg9"><mxGeometry x="4" y="280" width="482" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pmasterg10" value="Alarms &amp; history store — SP4" style="swimlane;rounded=1;startSize=30;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;swimlaneFillColor=#ffffff;horizontal=1;arcSize=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1080" y="440" width="490" height="142" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pmasterg10r0" value="• Alarm manager: every fault edge from every node → persistent log on LittleFS (2 × 64 KB rotating) + RAM ring for the UI" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="pmasterg10"><mxGeometry x="4" y="32" width="482" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pmasterg10r1" value="• History writer: samples from heartbeats, day files, oldest-first retention sweep" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="pmasterg10"><mxGeometry x="4" y="72" width="482" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pmasterg10r2" value="• NOTIFY stream on the console mirrors alarms/events live" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="pmasterg10"><mxGeometry x="4" y="112" width="482" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pmasterg11" value="Global climate &amp; water — SP5" style="swimlane;rounded=1;startSize=30;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;swimlaneFillColor=#ffffff;horizontal=1;arcSize=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1080" y="606" width="490" height="238" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pmasterg11r0" value="• Ventilation strategy on dew point / absolute humidity (SHT31 + psychrometrics) — not simple RH; chooses exhaust path workshop vs outside" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="pmasterg11"><mxGeometry x="4" y="32" width="482" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pmasterg11r1" value="• Damper interlocks: main fan only runs with intake + at least one exhaust open (re-checked every 100 ms); open/close never driven together; stuck detection" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="pmasterg11"><mxGeometry x="4" y="72" width="482" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pmasterg11r2" value="• Reservoir refill: only when level valid, below target, not HIGH; max run 300 s; cooldown; daily budget; no-rise fault; LOW level inhibits all pumps fleet-wide" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="pmasterg11"><mxGeometry x="4" y="112" width="482" height="56" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pmasterg11r3" value="• Blackout shutter control (pulse, max run)" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="pmasterg11"><mxGeometry x="4" y="168" width="482" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pmasterg11r4" value="• Fleet stop: SET SAFE ON → all zones dark within 2 s; self-releases if the master dies (zones keep growing)" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="pmasterg11"><mxGeometry x="4" y="192" width="482" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pmasterg12" value="Time service — SP3/SP5" style="swimlane;rounded=1;startSize=30;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;swimlaneFillColor=#ffffff;horizontal=1;arcSize=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1080" y="868" width="490" height="126" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pmasterg12r0" value="• DS3231 is the boot-time authority (no internet required, ever, for schedules)" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="pmasterg12"><mxGeometry x="4" y="32" width="482" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pmasterg12r1" value="• NTP over the house Wi-Fi corrects the RTC when available" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="pmasterg12"><mxGeometry x="4" y="56" width="482" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pmasterg12r2" value="• POSIX timezone → local-time offset (DST handled), distributed to all zones over the ring" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="pmasterg12"><mxGeometry x="4" y="80" width="482" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pmasterg13" value="Out of scope V1 (explicit)" style="swimlane;rounded=1;startSize=30;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#999999;swimlaneFillColor=#ffffff;horizontal=1;arcSize=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1080" y="1018" width="490" height="174" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pmasterg13r0" value="• Cloud / remote access (architecture keeps the door open; never required for operation)" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="pmasterg13"><mxGeometry x="4" y="32" width="482" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pmasterg13r1" value="• Heater / dehumidifier control (new actuator class later)" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="pmasterg13"><mxGeometry x="4" y="72" width="482" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pmasterg13r2" value="• Display / LCD on any node" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="pmasterg13"><mxGeometry x="4" y="96" width="482" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pmasterg13r3" value="• OTA of the rescue image itself (USB only) · ring-carried firmware bytes" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="pmasterg13"><mxGeometry x="4" y="120" width="482" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pmasterg13r4" value="• RS-485 transceivers on the ring (escalation path if CRC error counters climb)" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="pmasterg13"><mxGeometry x="4" y="144" width="482" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram id="zone" name="Zone Controller"><mxGraphModel dx="1400" dy="900" grid="0" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1600" pageHeight="1500" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="t0" value="HillGrow — Zone Controller: feature map" style="text;html=1;fontSize=22;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="16" width="900" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="t1" value="Review copy generated from the approved system spec (2026-08-31). All zones run one identical binary; every shelf is independently configured." style="text;html=1;fontSize=11;fontColor=#666666;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="48" width="1100" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pzoneg1" value="Hardware" style="swimlane;rounded=1;startSize=30;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;swimlaneFillColor=#ffffff;horizontal=1;arcSize=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="90" width="490" height="366" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pzoneg1r0" value="• ESP32-DevKitC-V4 — fits a 4 MB WROOM · the zone app NEVER starts Wi-Fi (design rule; frees ADC2)" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="pzoneg1"><mxGeometry x="4" y="32" width="482" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pzoneg1r1" value="• UART0 (GPIO1/3, USB): console — CLI + logs, 115200 (full standalone operation)" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="pzoneg1"><mxGeometry x="4" y="72" width="482" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pzoneg1r2" value="• UART2 ring: RX GPIO18 ← upstream · TX GPIO19 → downstream · store-and-forward" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="pzoneg1"><mxGeometry x="4" y="96" width="482" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pzoneg1r3" value="• PCA9685 @0x40 (I²C): 8 LED PWM channels = 4 shelves × (WHITE + RED) @ ~1 kHz · OE on GPIO23 with pull-up — lights hardware-dead through boot/crash/rescue · ch 8–15 spare (future fan PWM)" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="pzoneg1"><mxGeometry x="4" y="120" width="482" height="56" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pzoneg1r4" value="• PCF8575 @0x20 (I²C, active-low): P0–P3 pumps 1–4 · P4–P7 fans 1–4 · P8 pollination vibrator · P9–P15 spare relays" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="pzoneg1"><mxGeometry x="4" y="176" width="482" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pzoneg1r5" value="• Soil: 8 × DFRobot SEN0193 → ADC1 GPIO 32/33/34/35/36/39 + ADC2 GPIO 25/26 · 100 kΩ pull-downs · mV with eFuse calibration" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="pzoneg1"><mxGeometry x="4" y="216" width="482" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pzoneg1r6" value="• Loads: 24 V V24S LED bars via MOSFET drivers · 12 V peristaltic pumps, fans, vibrator via drivers — ESP32 never powers loads" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="pzoneg1"><mxGeometry x="4" y="256" width="482" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pzoneg1r7" value="• Rescue button GPIO15 · status LED GPIO2 (mode blink patterns) · spare GPIO 4/5/13/14" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="pzoneg1"><mxGeometry x="4" y="296" width="482" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pzoneg1r8" value="• Flash 4 MB: rescue 1280 K (factory) · app A/B 1280/1344 K · versioned NVS" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="pzoneg1"><mxGeometry x="4" y="336" width="482" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pzoneg2" value="CLI on UART0 — SP1" style="swimlane;rounded=1;startSize=30;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;swimlaneFillColor=#ffffff;horizontal=1;arcSize=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="480" width="490" height="262" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pzoneg2r0" value="• Complete standalone bring-up and operation: every config field (SET WATER 1 TARGET 60, SET LIGHT 1 ON 06:00 …), no master needed (sub-project 2 runs a zone solo)" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="pzoneg2"><mxGeometry x="4" y="32" width="482" height="56" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pzoneg2r1" value="• Manual actuator commands (duration-bounded) · calibration · GET SOIL/SENSORS/OUTPUTS/FAULTS · CLEAR FAULT" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="pzoneg2"><mxGeometry x="4" y="88" width="482" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pzoneg2r2" value="• GET CONFIG = replayable dump — export/import a zone by copy-paste" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="pzoneg2"><mxGeometry x="4" y="128" width="482" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pzoneg2r3" value="• Same grammar and scripts as via the master (ZONE 0 = this node; wrong id refused)" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="pzoneg2"><mxGeometry x="4" y="152" width="482" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pzoneg2r4" value="• SET FW UPDATE &lt;ssid&gt; &lt;pass&gt; &lt;url&gt;: bench rescue-pull without a master" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="pzoneg2"><mxGeometry x="4" y="192" width="482" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pzoneg2r5" value="• Human terminal comfort: echo, backspace, 10-line history, machine mode for test scripts, logs never split replies" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="pzoneg2"><mxGeometry x="4" y="216" width="482" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pzoneg3" value="Legend" style="swimlane;rounded=1;startSize=30;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#999999;swimlaneFillColor=#ffffff;horizontal=1;arcSize=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="766" width="490" height="134" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pzoneg3r0" value="• Colour = when it lands:  SP1 Foundation (blue) · SP2 Shelf control (green) · SP3 Ring link (orange) · SP4 Web UI (purple) · SP5 Global control (red) · Hardware (yellow) · Grey = out of scope V1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="pzoneg3"><mxGeometry x="4" y="32" width="482" height="56" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pzoneg3r1" value="• Source of truth: docs/superpowers/specs/2026-08-31-hillgrow-system-design.md (approved 2026-08-31) + docs/pin-mapping.md" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="pzoneg3"><mxGeometry x="4" y="88" width="482" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pzoneg4" value="Shelf × 1–4 — the reusable growing unit — SP2" style="swimlane;rounded=1;startSize=30;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;swimlaneFillColor=#ffffff;horizontal=1;arcSize=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="560" y="90" width="490" height="310" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pzoneg4r0" value="• Light: photoperiod on/off times + sunrise/sunset ramp · white/red % · per-shelf duty caps (installer) · daily light-hours budget · optional DLI target (turn off early when reached)" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="pzoneg4"><mxGeometry x="4" y="32" width="482" height="56" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pzoneg4r1" value="• Watering: moisture target + hysteresis · dose seconds → settle → response check (no-response latches a fault: dry reservoir/leak/dead pump) · minimum interval · daily budget · watering time window · one pump at a time per zone" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="pzoneg4"><mxGeometry x="4" y="88" width="482" height="56" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pzoneg4r2" value="• Circulation fan: OFF / ON / follow-light / duty-cycle (PWM speed is a future PCA9685 option)" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="pzoneg4"><mxGeometry x="4" y="144" width="482" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pzoneg4r3" value="• Soil sensing ×2 (A left, B right): kept separate — never blindly averaged · per-probe dry/wet calibration incl. live capture (SOILCAP) · open/short/out-of-range/stuck detection · A/B disagreement → use the wetter, halve the daily budget" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="pzoneg4"><mxGeometry x="4" y="184" width="482" height="72" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pzoneg4r4" value="• Crop = a name + a profile copy; zero crop-specific firmware logic" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="pzoneg4"><mxGeometry x="4" y="256" width="482" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pzoneg4r5" value="• Per-shelf runtime + fault state, reported in every heartbeat" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="pzoneg4"><mxGeometry x="4" y="280" width="482" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pzoneg5" value="Optional zone devices — SP2" style="swimlane;rounded=1;startSize=30;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;swimlaneFillColor=#ffffff;horizontal=1;arcSize=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="560" y="424" width="490" height="118" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pzoneg5r0" value="• Pollination vibrator: short pulses (≤10 s), interval, daytime window — pure configuration (tomato zones)" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="pzoneg5"><mxGeometry x="4" y="32" width="482" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pzoneg5r1" value="• Spare relays P9–P15: future actuators via config; manual overrides always duration-bounded" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="pzoneg5"><mxGeometry x="4" y="72" width="482" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pzoneg6" value="Config &amp; persistence — SP1" style="swimlane;rounded=1;startSize=30;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;swimlaneFillColor=#ffffff;horizontal=1;arcSize=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="560" y="566" width="490" height="198" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pzoneg6r0" value="• Hardware plane (zone-owned, unlock-gated): shelf count, PCA/PCF channel maps, soil channel maps, calibration, per-shelf safety limits" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="pzoneg6"><mxGeometry x="4" y="32" width="482" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pzoneg6r1" value="• Logical plane (master-owned once linked, cached locally): crop, light/water/fan/pollination settings — a zone reboots into full operation with no master" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="pzoneg6"><mxGeometry x="4" y="72" width="482" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pzoneg6r2" value="• Daily safety counters survive reboots (RTC memory + NVS) — a brown-out loop cannot defeat the watering budget" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="pzoneg6"><mxGeometry x="4" y="112" width="482" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pzoneg6r3" value="• All blobs versioned (magic+version+CRC); a blob newer than the firmware is rejected, so OTA rollback is always safe" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="pzoneg6"><mxGeometry x="4" y="152" width="482" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pzoneg7" value="Safety manager — SP2" style="swimlane;rounded=1;startSize=30;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;swimlaneFillColor=#ffffff;horizontal=1;arcSize=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1080" y="90" width="490" height="350" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pzoneg7r0" value="• One gate for every output; CLI/web/ring requests all pass the same interlocks — nothing bypasses local safety" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="pzoneg7"><mxGeometry x="4" y="32" width="482" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pzoneg7r1" value="• Every ON is a lease: pump max-run (hard cap 300 s) · daily budgets · min-off cooldowns · light duty/day caps · overrides expire" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="pzoneg7"><mxGeometry x="4" y="72" width="482" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pzoneg7r2" value="• LOCAL mode: master silent 30 s → all plant care continues indefinitely on local schedule + sensors; master inhibit flags age out after 600 s" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="pzoneg7"><mxGeometry x="4" y="112" width="482" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pzoneg7r3" value="• Modes BOOT/TRIAL/HOLD/RUN/LOCAL/SAFE · crash-loop ladder bounds output pulsing, then latches SAFE with CLI alive for diagnosis" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="pzoneg7"><mxGeometry x="4" y="152" width="482" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pzoneg7r4" value="• Boot-safe outputs: PCF8575 ← all-off first transaction + 1 s read-back audit · PCA9685 OE released only in RUN/LOCAL · TWDT ISR kills lights in microseconds · shutdown handler on every reboot (accepted residual: ≤0.5 s pump hold on a hard crash)" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="pzoneg7"><mxGeometry x="4" y="192" width="482" height="72" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pzoneg7r5" value="• Sensor-invalid policies decide watering (block / halve budget) · time-unknown fallback schedule (assumed 08:00 boot)" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="pzoneg7"><mxGeometry x="4" y="264" width="482" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pzoneg7r6" value="• Faults: fixed severity (warn / blocks-scope / SAFE), latched ones need explicit clear, all visible in heartbeat + GET FAULTS" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="pzoneg7"><mxGeometry x="4" y="304" width="482" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pzoneg8" value="Ring node — SP3" style="swimlane;rounded=1;startSize=30;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;swimlaneFillColor=#ffffff;horizontal=1;arcSize=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1080" y="464" width="490" height="302" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pzoneg8r0" value="• Store-and-forward relay: COBS framing, CRC-16 recomputed per hop, TTL, break-tolerant (unpowered upstream handled)" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="pzoneg8"><mxGeometry x="4" y="32" width="482" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pzoneg8r1" value="• Heartbeat every 2 s = health + full telemetry + fault masks + comm counters (master sees a fault within 2 s)" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="pzoneg8"><mxGeometry x="4" y="72" width="482" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pzoneg8r2" value="• Commands arrive as CLI text → same dispatcher, same safety gate · exactly-once execution (retransmits replay the cached reply)" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="pzoneg8"><mxGeometry x="4" y="112" width="482" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pzoneg8r3" value="• Enrolment: boots unassigned, advertises MAC, accepts ASSIGN_ID; id survives in NVS; board swaps handled by MAC" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="pzoneg8"><mxGeometry x="4" y="152" width="482" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pzoneg8r4" value="• TIME_SYNC: sets the clock, carries fleet inhibit flags" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="pzoneg8"><mxGeometry x="4" y="192" width="482" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pzoneg8r5" value="• Config chunks: reassemble → validate → apply atomically → ACK with the exact error path on refusal; console edits while linked are reverted (master wins)" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="pzoneg8"><mxGeometry x="4" y="216" width="482" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pzoneg8r6" value="• FW_UPDATE: safe state → handover record → reboot into rescue (pull from master AP)" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="pzoneg8"><mxGeometry x="4" y="256" width="482" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pzoneg9" value="Rescue &amp; bootloader — SP1" style="swimlane;rounded=1;startSize=30;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;swimlaneFillColor=#ffffff;horizontal=1;arcSize=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1080" y="790" width="490" height="182" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pzoneg9r0" value="• Same shared rescue image and bootloader triggers as the master (RTC flag · GPIO15 hold · NVS-erase hold)" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="pzoneg9"><mxGeometry x="4" y="32" width="482" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pzoneg9r1" value="• Pull mode: joins the master AP, downloads zone.bin, flashes the inactive slot, reboots — fully automatic fleet updates" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="pzoneg9"><mxGeometry x="4" y="72" width="482" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pzoneg9r2" value="• Manual mode: own AP + upload page — recover any bricked zone with a phone" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="pzoneg9"><mxGeometry x="4" y="112" width="482" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pzoneg9r3" value="• While a zone sits in rescue, its UART repeater keeps the ring closed for everyone downstream" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="pzoneg9"><mxGeometry x="4" y="136" width="482" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>